# Canva Project Launcher - Claude Skill

A custom Claude Skill that automates project folder structure creation in Canva and Notion with a single command.

## What it does

This skill enables Claude to automatically create standardized project folder structures in Canva and Notion when you type a simple command like:

```
start project ClientName_2025-10-18
```

Claude will parse the project name and date, then create the complete folder hierarchy in your Canva or Notion account.


## How it works

This is a Claude Agent Skill - a reusable workflow that's always available across all your Claude conversations. Simply mention the command, and Claude handles the rest using the Canva API integration.

## Installation

1. Download the `SKILL.md` file from this repository
2. Upload it to Claude.ai (Settings → Skills) or use it in Claude Code
3. That's it! The skill is now available in all your conversations

## Requirements

- Claude Pro, Team, or Enterprise account
- Canva and Notion account connected to Claude

## Usage

Just type in any Claude conversation:
```
start project [ProjectName]_[YYYY-MM-DD]
```

Claude will automatically:
- Validate the date format
- Create the root project folder
- Set up the standardized subfolder structure
- Confirm completion with folder links

